'* Thành phần:
- R1: MES buffer (pH 6,5) 6,5 mmol/l;
N, N-Bis(4-sulfobutyl)-3- methylaniline) 3 mmol/l; 
Polyvinyl sulfonic acid 50 mg/l;
Polyethylene-glycol-methyl ester 30 ml/l; 
MgCl2 2 mmol/.
- R2: MES buffer (pH 6,5) 50 mmol/l;
Cholesterol esterase 5 kU/l; Cholesterol oxidase 20 kU/l;
Peroxidase 5 kU/l; 4-aminoantipyrine 0,9 g/l; Detergent 0,5 %.
* Bộ gồm: R1: 1 lọ 30ml, R2: 1 lọ 10ml.
